      <description>&lt;p&gt;There is no required text, but &lt;a href=&#34;../../pages/lecture-notes-and-worksheets/index.html&#34;&gt;lecture notes&lt;/a&gt; are provided. We make reference to material in the five books listed below. In addition, there are citations and links to other references.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;[Washington] = Washington, Lawrence C. &lt;em&gt;Elliptic Curves: Number Theory and Cryptography&lt;/em&gt;. Chapman &amp;amp; Hall / CRC, 2008. ISBN: 9781420071467. (&lt;a   class=&#34;external-link &#34;   target=&#34;_blank&#34;   href=&#34;http://www.math.umd.edu/%7Elcw/ECerrata.pdf&#34;  aria-label=&#34;Errata (PDF) (opens in a new tab)&#34;  &gt;Errata (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;) [Preview with &lt;a   class=&#34;external-link &#34;   target=&#34;_blank&#34;   href=&#34;http://books.google.com/books?id=nBfCEqpYKW0C&amp;amp;pg=PAfrontcover&#34;  aria-label=&#34;Google Books (opens in a new tab)&#34;  &gt;Google Books&lt;/a&gt;]. &lt;a   class=&#34;external-link &#34;   target=&#34;_blank&#34;   href=&#34;https://www.taylorfrancis.com/books/9780429140808&#34;  aria-label=&#34;Online version (opens in a new tab)&#34;  &gt;Online version&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
